      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Branch estate \u00b7 service quality\nMeasured per session from encrypted-traffic metadata (no payloads, no decryption). *Reachability* is what up/down monitoring sees; the other tiles are what customers actually get. Violet bands are injected incidents."
      },
